{"parse": {"title": "12TH-13", "pageid": 127798, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/12TH-12\" title=\"12TH-12\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">12TH-13</span><a href=\"/wiki/12TH-14\" title=\"12TH-14\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">12TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">13</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.AF.80.E5.88.AB.E4.B9.A6\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"诀别书\">诀别书</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 诀别书</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Farewell Letter</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>不<span class=\"color-value\"></span>论<span class=\"color-value\"></span>何<span class=\"color-value\"></span>时<span class=\"color-value\"></span>何<span class=\"color-value\"></span>地<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>总<span class=\"color-value\"></span>有<span class=\"color-value\"></span>年<span class=\"color-value\"></span>轻<span class=\"color-value\"></span>人<span class=\"color-value\"></span>跨<span class=\"color-value\"></span>上<span class=\"color-value\"></span>战<span class=\"color-value\"></span>马<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>告<span class=\"color-value\"></span>别<span class=\"color-value\"></span>故<span class=\"color-value\"></span>乡<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 11213</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_13.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_13\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_13\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-3_3_bg_13.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_13.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-3_3_bg_13.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_13.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-3_3_bg_13.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_13.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529812.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-529812.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529812.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529812.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-529812.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529812.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-529812.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529812.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>……那么，这就是你和伊戈尔商议的作战计划？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>斯捷尔诺娃与军长隔着地图桌相对而立，她焦躁地将用来代表军事力量的指示物挪来挪去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>军长抬头看了她一眼，尽管后者并未言明，但她的态度不言而喻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>把那个狮鹫放下吧，斯捷尔诺娃，现在我们和伊戈尔站在同一条船上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>斯捷尔诺娃挥了挥手，把狮鹫木雕甩到了地图的边缘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>我非常认同你提出的作战计划，军长，但我仍然不认为可以放心地把后背交给伊戈尔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529812.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-529812.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529812.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529812.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-529812.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529812.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-529812.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529812.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>天黑后，让骑兵军放弃辎重，沿左岸向上游发动奇袭，清扫所有遭遇的敌方部队并切断格鲁托夫的补给路线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529816.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-529816.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529816.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529816.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-529816.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529816.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-529816.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529816.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>——我不怀疑计划的可行性，骑兵们熟悉河岸的田地与山谷，我军的机动性能得到最大程度的发挥。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529814.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/HeadIconSmall-529814.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529814.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529814.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/HeadIconSmall-529814.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529814.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/HeadIconSmall-529814.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529814.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>但把右岸林地、塞契与别列格勒的城防交给伊戈尔，让他来保护我们的后方——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-529810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-529810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-529810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>这和把羊肉送到狮子嘴里有什么区别？只要伊戈尔愿意，骑兵军随时会身处腹背受敌的境况。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>如果同盟的两军不能互相信任，那只会被逐一击破，任何作战计划都无从谈起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>你已经见识过格鲁托夫的军队了，骑兵军和民兵团都没有能力应付敌人的空中力量和地面的重武器。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>如果没有伊戈尔带来的几台高射炮，别列格勒在第一轮空袭中就能被炸成废墟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她想起撤离别列格勒时，印在视野中的被航空炸弹削去半边拱顶的救济院。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>狮鹫军装备精良，但人数不多，而且没有建立完备的补给线。他们更适合依托城市和林地构筑防线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>所以，把城市和林地交给伊戈尔，骑兵军从侧翼找机会袭击敌军，我和伊戈尔都认为这是一个合理的选择。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>但……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她变得有些迟疑。她知道长官是对的，可南美洲的硝烟仍是笼罩在这场合作之上的阴霾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>我理解你的疑虑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>军长拿起狮鹫木雕，让它降落在塞契。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>伊戈尔本人会留在骑兵军塞契，不会前往前线。而他与麾下部队的每一次通话都会处于我们的监控之下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>我们的联络电台没有侵入伊戈尔方面线路的能力，要怎么窃听他？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>不，我们不需要窃听他。在回营地的路上，我已经向伊戈尔提过公开通讯的要求。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>他同意了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>斯捷尔诺娃迟疑地点了点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>我还是会盯着他的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309213.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-309213.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309213.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309213.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-309213.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309213.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-309213.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309213.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>——我非常欢迎你的监督，上校。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不请自来的叛军将领走入营帐，踩在了参谋长本就紧绷的神经上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔顶着斯捷尔诺娃审视的目光，将一份文件放在了沙盘上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>这是什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>我手上关于格鲁托夫本人的所有资料。履历、心理状态报告，以及他的神秘术登记表。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一份及时雨般的情报，同时也是一份绝佳的“诚意”。它成功让斯捷尔诺娃欲言又止，让合作得以延续。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>好吧，过去我确实不太了解格鲁托夫。在开战之前，我会仔细看完你给我的资料。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>午前的烈日下，一些模糊的影子被投射在营帐的幕墙上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>帐篷外有人？他们在做什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>我在进来之前，看见营地里有一些军官在商量什么事。也许聚在外面的就是他们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>莎宾娜，和我一起出去看看。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_10.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_10\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_10\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/Cg-3_3_bg_10.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_10.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/Cg-3_3_bg_10.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_10.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/Cg-3_3_bg_10.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_10.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>这是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>果然有不少人围在营帐之外——如伊戈尔所料，这些人大多都是军官。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们手贴着裤缝，表情复杂，谨慎地站在距离帐门数米开外的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>骑兵军马上就要出征了，你们像这样聚在一起，是想做什么呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>第五团团长从队伍中向前一小步，行了一个标准的军礼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-531101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-531101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-531101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">山羊胡骑兵：</div><div>军长，我将代表军官和士兵们向您提出请求，希望得到您的首肯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>军官代表深吸一口气。下巴上的山羊胡微微颤抖着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-531101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-531101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-531101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">山羊胡骑兵：</div><div>军里有不少人的家就在附近，往返营地不过半天。他们希望能赶在动身之前，回家看一看亲人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-531101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-531101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-531101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">山羊胡骑兵：</div><div>我们不是害怕即将到来的战斗，哥萨克们都愿意为了顿河流干最后一滴血。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-531101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-531101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-531101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">山羊胡骑兵：</div><div>因为我们的父母、祖父母，还有他们的父母与祖父母，都生活在草原上，都是骁勇的战士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-531101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-531101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-531101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">山羊胡骑兵：</div><div>但我们也知道，明日的太阳升起后，很多人会死在战场上，这也许是他们最后一次与亲人见面的机会，所以……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>骑兵团长咬着牙，似乎忘记了准备好的、将要在军长面前说的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他干脆就此闭上嘴。毕竟最重要的请求已经给出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>军长背过手，仿佛并未听见团长的请求。他的视线在一顶顶哥萨克军帽上掠过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>军官们追随着军长的视线，没有任何人敢打破这份寂静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>随后，他举起左手，置于耳旁，向后摆了摆手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>半天能回营地的，允许回家探亲。快去快回。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>骑兵军官中爆发出一阵苦涩的欢呼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>营帐边的情绪很快向四周传递，营地内的其他士兵旋即从这股热烈的氛围中得知了军长的答复。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>今晚出发前，我要看到全员在草原塞契归队，违者以逃兵论处！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>骑兵们在此起彼伏的“遵命”“谢谢”中离开了。军长长叹一口气，与斯捷尔诺娃对视了一眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>你打算回红柳树村吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>不了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他摇了摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>进来吧，出发之前，我们还有不少事要处理。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_13.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_13\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_13\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-3_3_bg_13.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_13.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-3_3_bg_13.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_13.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-3_3_bg_13.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_13.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>军长将一沓空白的信纸放在桌上，推向斯捷尔诺娃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>传令给所有没有回家的人，留封信吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>斯捷尔诺娃神色晦暗地看着信纸，又看了看桌后的军长与伊戈尔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最后，她点了点头，抱着大半信纸退出了临时会议室。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>大战前允许士兵返乡，不是一位英明指挥官的举措。仁慈会挫伤士气，家人的关怀容易使士兵丧失斗志。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>他们会回来的，一个不落。你应该和我一样了解这群哥萨克。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>他们决不允许顿河变成流淌亲人鲜血的红河，这时候放他们回家，只会让士气烧得更猛烈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>军长淡然地为自己和临时盟友斟了杯添加了胡椒的黑茶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>你很信任他们，但他们甚至都不知道你真正的来历，也不明白芝诺想要他们做什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>对家乡的眷恋会妨碍骑兵军真正的任务，总有一天他们会离开顿河，前往其他战场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>这些话我在他们入伍的时候都已经说过了。新兵嘴上说明白，可心里始终不相信真有离开家乡的那一天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>战火会平等地焚烧每一寸土地，但也会把军队中的纽带炼成牢不可破的锁链。看来你仍然相信这一点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>那你呢，伊万？你为什么不回去一趟？往返红柳树村的路，在别列格勒城陷落前还算安全。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊万拿起茶杯，啜饮一口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>还是说，你终究认为1920年的顿河并不真正属于你，你也没有做好准备，告知你的士兵们关于时代的真相。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>军长正了正制服领口，他在寻找一个可以岔开话题的方式。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>我没必要向你解释什么。还有，在我这儿，你也享有和其他人相同的待遇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>什么意思？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>我是说，你也可以给自己的亲人写封信。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>意料之外的提议让伊戈尔陷入了沉默。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>格鲁托夫是冲着你本人来的，如果前线失利，你多半无法从战场脱身。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>那么，你没有需要道别的亲人吗？还是说，这个时代的一切，对你而言都是过眼烟云？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔将热茶一口饮尽，起身，重新披上大衣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309221.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-309221.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309221.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309221.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-309221.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309221.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-309221.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309221.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>再见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>希望战争结束后，我们不会再见面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔从军长桌上取走了几张信纸，离开了营帐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>军长独自站立着，仿佛在等待什么事情到来。不多时，接通指挥部的电台如预料般发出了警报般的提示音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芝诺指挥部：</div><div>布列科夫少将，司辰已经安全了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-529614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-529614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-529614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>司辰处在安全地点，她说已经初步完成了在别列格勒的任务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芝诺指挥部：</div><div>初步完成？那就够了，这足够我们向基金会的委员交差。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芝诺指挥部：</div><div>你在顿河的任务结束了，立刻撤出该区域。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-529610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-529610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-529610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>立刻？——原本的命令是在两周的时间内确保别列格勒的安全。骑兵军正在执行领受的任务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-529614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-529614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-529614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>有一支受重塑之手援助的匪军正在威胁顿河地区，骑兵军会留下来解决他们之后再离开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芝诺指挥部：</div><div>别列格勒和顿河在全局战略中并不重要。重塑之手的主力全在西线，在兵力有限的情况下，我们只能放弃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芝诺指挥部：</div><div>我们没法给你两周时间了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-529614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-529614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-529614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>那我只需要五天。五天之内，我就能解决顿河的问题，之后骑兵军会立即前往匈牙利。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芝诺指挥部：</div><div>解决？和伊戈尔的叛军一起解决？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-529601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-529601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-529601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芝诺指挥部：</div><div>不要以为指挥部不知道你和伊戈尔叛军的交往，为了司辰，伊里内伊的人可以睁一只眼闭一只眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芝诺指挥部：</div><div>但既然司辰已经离开了，你继续和伊戈尔合作的理由是什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芝诺指挥部：</div><div>如果委员会发起质询，你想好了要怎么回答吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529613.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-529613.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529613.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529613.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-529613.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529613.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-529613.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529613.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>…………</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芝诺指挥部：</div><div>布列科夫少将？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芝诺指挥部：</div><div>伊万·伊万诺维奇，你听见我说的话了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芝诺指挥部：</div><div>伊万，你会酿成大祸的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-529612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-529612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-529612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>……我和我的骑兵军会保卫我们的家乡，我们的家人，所以我选择与伊戈尔的叛军合作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-529614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-529614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-529614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>这是我在军事法庭上会给出的答复。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "12TH-13"}}